#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Cancel a job {#cancel-a-job}"
msgstr "Batalkan kerja {#cancel-a-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can cancel a job from the IBM Quantum Platform dashboard either on the "
"Workloads page or the details page for a specific workload. On the Workloads"
" page, click the overflow menu at the end of the row for that workload, and "
"select Cancel. If you are on the details page for a specific workload, use "
"the Actions dropdown at the top of the page, and select Cancel.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anda boleh membatalkan kerja daripada papan pemuka IBM Quantum Platform sama"
" ada di halaman Beban Kerja atau halaman butiran untuk beban kerja tertentu."
" Di halaman Beban Kerja, klik menu limpahan di hujung baris untuk beban "
"kerja tersebut, dan pilih Batalkan. Jika anda berada di halaman butiran "
"untuk beban kerja tertentu, gunakan menu lungsur Tindakan di bahagian atas "
"halaman, dan pilih Batalkan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In Qiskit, use `job.cancel()` to cancel a job.\n"
msgstr "Dalam Qiskit, gunakan `job.cancel()` untuk membatalkan kerja.\n"

